{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And all the days of Noah were nine hundred years and fifty years, and he died.</b> And if you ask: is it not written above 'in the six hundredth year of Noah's life' etc., and here it writes 'and Noah lived after the flood three hundred and fifty years' — if so, we find an extra year. One may answer: the year of the flood was not counted in the tally, as we said above."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:41.150329286Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}